\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Pence tells Republicans to take hard line on  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  despite electoral liability\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 758 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 June 2023\par 17:54 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Former vice-president calls for federal 15-week \u8216\'20\'18minimum\u8217\'20\'19 ban in contrast to Trump who suggested issue cost party votes\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/06/23/mike-pence-abortion-dobbs-roe-anniversary-00103353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Speaking}}}\uc2  one year since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  removed the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2  said candidates for the 2024 Republican presidential nomination should stand firm on the electorally unpopular issue and take a hard line on bringing in national limits.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFor me, for our campaign, we\u8217\'20\'19re going to stand where we\u8217\'20\'19ve always stood, and that is without apology for the right to life,\u8221\'20\'1D the former congressman, Indiana governor and vice-president to \uc2 Donald Trump{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/06/23/mike-pence-abortion-dobbs-roe-anniversary-00103353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Politico}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Later, addressing the Faith & Freedom conference in Washington, Pence said every Republican candidate \u8220\'20\'1Cshould support a ban on abortions before 15 weeks, as a minimum nationwide standard\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Claiming this was a \u8220\'20\'1Creasonable and mainstream standard\u8221\'20\'1D, Pence said: \u8220\'20\'1CAmerican \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy has more in common with China and North Korea than it does with the nations of Europe \u8211\'20\'13 and it is time for that to change.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In response, Shwetika Baijal, spokesperson for Planned Parenthood Votes, a political group associated with the women\u8217\'20\'19s health provider, accused the former vice-president of \u8220\'20\'1Cspew[ing] harmful anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights rhetoric\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The ruling which removed the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/28/samuel-alito-draft-abortion-ruling-supreme-court-justice"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dobbs v Jackson}}}\uc2 , was released on 24 June 2022.\par \par \uc2 Since then, Democrats have enjoyed electoral success through painting Republicans as threats to women\u8217\'20\'19s right to control their own bodies. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://navigatorresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Navigator-Update-06.23.2023.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polling}}}\uc2  consistently returns {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/religion/fact-sheet/public-opinion-on-abortion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 majorities in favour}}}\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. On Friday, Navigator, a progressive firm, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://navigatorresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Navigator-Update-06.23.2023.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  60% of voters now identify as pro-choice.\par \par \uc2 Other candidates for the Republican nomination have struggled to define their stances on the issue. Many observers suggest the Florida governor, \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , the closest challenger to the frontrunner, Trump, would face problems in a general election given his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/apr/13/florida-six-week-abortion-ban-republicans#:~:text=The%20Republican%2Ddominated%20Florida%20legislature,for%20an%20expected%20presidential%20run."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signing}}}\uc2  of a six-week ban.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis has avoided the subject, but, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/06/23/mike-pence-abortion-dobbs-roe-anniversary-00103353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speaking to Politico}}}\uc2 , Pence was far from coy. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said, would help decide \u8220\'20\'1Cwhether or not we\u8217\'20\'19re going to continue to be a party grounded in conservative principles \u8230\'20\'26 or whether our party is going to shy away from those core traditional principles\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Pence also claimed recent Republican reverses had a \u8220\'20\'1Ccommon denominator [that] has not to do with the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Rather, where candidates were focused on \u8230\'20\'26 re-litigating the past[,] we did not fare well.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Politico {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/06/23/mike-pence-abortion-dobbs-roe-anniversary-00103353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  that a \u8220\'20\'1Cveiled reference\u8221\'20\'1D to Trump\u8217\'20\'19s lies about electoral fraud in his 2020 defeat by \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , culminating in the January 6 attack.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPence brought up Trump several times unprompted,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/06/23/mike-pence-abortion-dobbs-roe-anniversary-00103353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the site said}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1Cthough never by name \u8211\'20\'13 arguing that Trump\u8217\'20\'19s suggestion that the Dobbs ruling undercut the GOP in 2022 was \u8216\'20\'18wrong\u8217\'20\'19 and hitting back at Trump for criticizing DeSantis\u8217\'20\'19s six-week ban as \u8216\'20\'18too harsh\u8217\'20\'19.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In contrast to the evangelical Pence, Trump is a known womaniser who in 2016 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2016/apr/02/donald-trump-marueen-dowd-interview-abortion-past-partners"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dodged}}}\uc2  a question about whether he had ever been \u8220\'20\'1Cinvolved with anyone who had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSuch an interesting question,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D Trump told the \uc2 New York Times\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CSo what\u8217\'20\'19s your next question?\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Trump still {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.fivethirtyeight.com/polls/president-primary-r/2024/national/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dominates}}}\uc2  the 2024 race, even while under state and federal indictments, the former over a payoff to a porn star, the latter over his retention of classified records. He was also found liable for sexual assault, against the writer E Jean Carroll.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn my announcement speech,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/06/23/mike-pence-abortion-dobbs-roe-anniversary-00103353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pence told Politico}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CI articulated my concern that my former running mate and other candidates \u8230\'20\'26 are backing away from an unwavering commitment to the right to life.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s not consistent with the kind of principled leadership I believe Republicans are looking for in the cause of life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Politico {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/06/23/mike-pence-abortion-dobbs-roe-anniversary-00103353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  Pence dodged questions on whether DeSantis\u8217\'20\'19s ban was too harsh and whether House Republicans should pass a nationwide ban of the sort he called for on Friday.\par \par \uc2 Claiming he stood for \u8220\'20\'1Ccompassion\u8221\'20\'1D, Pence told the site he would fund \u8220\'20\'1Ccrisis pregnancy centres\u8221\'20\'1D and make adoption more affordable.\par \par \uc2 Asked what he would say to women who believe conservatives want to control their bodies, Pence said he hoped they \u8220\'20\'1Chear my heart\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In her statement, Baijal of Planned Parenthood Votes said: \u8220\'20\'1CPublic opinion will not change. The overwhelming majority of Americans support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights and do not want politicians in their doctor\u8217\'20\'19s office.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C[Pence\u8217\'20\'19s] GOP primary rivals seem to understand this and are desperately trying to avoid talking or answering questions about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But Pence keeps boastfully sharing his extreme anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  agenda out loud.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230623ej6n001xh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
