\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 These 1,572 US politicians have helped ban  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  since Roe fell. They\u8217\'20\'19re mostly men\b0\par\par\uc2 Ava Sasani, graphics by Andrew Witherspoon \par \uc2 237 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 June 2023\par 17:52 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 These are the faces of lawmakers and governors whose votes helped pass bans on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s been one year since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ended the constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The procedure is now prohibited in 14 states and restricted in six more, leaving large swaths of the midwest and south without access to basic reproductive care.\par \par \uc2 To mark the first anniversary of the Dobbs v Jackson Women\u8217\'20\'19s Health Organization decision, the case that overturned Roe v Wade, the Guardian has created a visual directory of state legislators who embraced the opportunity to restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access. These are the faces of lawmakers and governors whose votes helped pass bans on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at conception or after six weeks, before most women know they are pregnant.\par \par \uc2 Because of the sheer volume of anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws that have taken effect over the past year, bans that predate Roe \u8211\'20\'13 like the 19th-century statute that Republicans are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/03/wisconsin-supreme-court-election-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trying to resurrect in Wisconsin}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 are not included here. Additional bans in Wyoming, Ohio, Utah and North Dakota are also excluded, because state courts have indefinitely blocked those laws from taking effect. The remaining nearly 1,600 legislators in this graphic are responsible for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/abortion-laws-by-state-map-clinics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 chaotic patchwork of \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  restrictions}}}\uc2  that has emerged in the year without Roe.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230622ej6m0025t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
