\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 DeSantis envisions \u8216\'20\'18quarter-century\u8217\'20\'19 of far-right majority in the supreme court\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in New York \par \uc2 650 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 May 2023\par 17:50 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Speaking to Christian media, the Florida governor suggested a 7-2 conservative majority in the high court if he is elected president\par \par \uc2 In a speech to Christian media in Orlando, Florida\u8217\'20\'19s governor, \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , envisaged the creation of a \u8220\'20\'1C7-2 conservative majority that would last a quarter-century\u8221\'20\'1D on the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  should he be elected president next year.\par \par \uc2 Speaking to the National Religious Broadcasters Convention, DeSantis said: \u8220\'20\'1CI think if you look over the next two presidential terms, there is a good chance that you could be called upon to seek replacements for Justice \uc2 Clarence Thomas\uc2  and Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2  and the issue with that is, you can\u8217\'20\'19t really do better than those two.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Supreme court justices serve for life or until they choose to retire. Thomas, who has rejected {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/may/09/clarence-thomas-supreme-court-resignation-crow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calls to resign}}}\uc2  over his relationship with a Republican mega-donor, is 74. Alito is 73. Both are hard-right figures on a court tipped firmly right, 6-3.\par \par \uc2 But DeSantis also alluded to a chance to replace \uc2 Sonia Sotomayor\uc2 , a liberal appointed by Barack Obama who is now 68, or perhaps \uc2 Elena Kagan\uc2 , another Obama appointee who is now 63, should he win the White House and serve two full terms.\par \par \uc2 He said: \u8220\'20\'1CSo it is possible that in those eight years, we have the opportunity to fortify justices \u8230\'20\'26 Alito and Thomas as well as actually make improvements with those others, and if you were able to do that, you would have a 7-2 conservative majority on the supreme court that would last a quarter-century.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2023/05/22/desantis-supreme-court-christian-broadcasters-convention/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to the Washington Post}}}\uc2 , DeSantis\u8217\'20\'19s comments were met with \u8220\'20\'1Craucous applause\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The governor also took a shot at \uc2 John Roberts\uc2 , the conservative chief justice who has sided with liberals on key decisions, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2022/07/26/politics/supreme-court-john-roberts-abortion-dobbs/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 including}}}\uc2  the one last year which eliminated federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf you replace a \uc2 Clarence Thomas\uc2  with somebody like a Roberts or somebody like that,\u8221\'20\'1D DeSantis said, \u8220\'20\'1Cthen you\u8217\'20\'19re gonna actually see the court move to the left, and you can\u8217\'20\'19t do that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Under Roberts, the court has moved to the right.\par \par \uc2 Last year, Alito {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/opinions/2023/05/02/alito-supreme-court-leak-dobbs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  the opinion in Dobbs v Jackson, which removed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. Thomas {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://slate.com/news-and-politics/2022/06/supreme-court-new-york-concealed-carry-law-gun-control-bruen.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  the opinion in New York State Rifle and Pistol Association v Bruen, striking down a gun control law in place since 1911.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis, 44, is expected to announce his campaign for the Republican presidential nomination this week.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , 76, is the clear frontrunner to face President \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , who is 80 and beat Trump in 2020. On Monday, however, Fox News {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxnews.com/politics/over-100-former-trump-administration-officials-back-desantis-president-proven-winner"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that 100 Trump White House alumni have formed a pro-DeSantis group called the Eight-Year Alliance.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis is preparing to launch a campaign fueled by hard-right state legislation. Notable policies have included a crackdown on the teaching of LGBTQ+ issues and of race in US history, legislation targeting trans people in public life, a loosening of gun control laws and a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 Many observers say that record may prove too extreme for voters in a presidential election.\par \par \uc2 On \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, for example, public opinion is consistently against the kind of extreme bans recently passed in Republican states.\par \par \uc2 In Orlando, the Post said, DeSantis \u8220\'20\'1Cpromoted the six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban he helped enact this year \u8230\'20\'26 a divisive topic he tends to brush past, even with staunchly conservative audiences\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The governor\u8217\'20\'19s comments were \u8220\'20\'1Cbrief\u8221\'20\'1D, the Post said. But when he said his ban was meant to \u8220\'20\'1Cprotect an unborn child that has a detectable heartbeat\u8221\'20\'1D, he was \u8220\'20\'1Cdrowned out by extended cheers\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Gynecologists {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2019/apr/24/its-not-a-little-child-gynecologists-join-the-fight-against-six-week-abortion-bans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 say}}}\uc2  fetuses do not have heartbeats at six weeks, a stage at which many women {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ansirh.org/research/research/one-three-people-learn-theyre-pregnant-past-six-weeks-gestation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 do not know}}}\uc2  they are pregnant.\par \par \uc2 In Orlando, DeSantis said his ban was \u8220\'20\'1Cthe right thing to do\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230523ej5n001mp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
