\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 When De Niro is having a child at 79, it\u8217\'20\'19s time to cut older mothers some slack\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,132 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 May 2023\par 13:50 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The average age for new parents in the US is on the rise but the stigma attached to \u8216\'20\'18geriatric\u8217\'20\'19 mothers in their 30s is ridiculous\par \par \uc2 Meet the (much older) parents\par \par \uc2 In a world where US birth rates were declining, one man decided to embark on a heroic journey to father as many children as he could. That man is called Robert De Niro and he has just had his seventh child at the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-65542079"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grand old age of 79}}}\uc2 . His new daughter is around half a century younger than his oldest kids.\par \par \uc2 While he may be on the extreme end of things, it\u8217\'20\'19s not just De Niro who is having kids later in life. American parents, in general, are getting older. A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://arstechnica.com/science/2017/08/us-dads-of-newborns-are-greying-percentage-over-40-doubled-since-the-70s/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2017 study by Stanford researchers}}}\uc2  found that the average age of a new dad in the US rose from 27.4 to 30.1 in the years between 1972 and 2015. The percentage of new dads in their 40s doubled during that time, to almost 9%. And the percentage of new fathers aged 50 and above increased from 0.5% to 0.9%. Germany and England are seeing similar trends in advanced paternal age.\par \par \uc2 Mothers in rich countries are also getting older. In 2022 the median age of women giving birth in the US rose to 30 for the first time. In recent decades birthrates have declined for women in their 20s and increased for women in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usnews.com/news/us/articles/2022-05-06/motherhood-deferred-us-median-age-for-giving-birth-hits-30"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 their late 30s and early 40s.}}}\uc2  And women with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2021/may/21/naomi-campbell-motherhood-women-reproductive-choices"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resources}}}\uc2  to use surrogates and reproductive technology are having kids even later: Naomi Campbell recently had her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/fashion/2022/feb/14/naomi-campbell-says-becoming-a-mother-at-50-best-thing-ive-done"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first child at the age of 50}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While both men and women may be waiting longer to have kids, women tend to be judged a lot more harshly for it. There is still a ridiculous amount of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thebump.com/news/older-mom-stigma"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stigma}}}\uc2  attached to \u8220\'20\'1Colder\u8221\'20\'1D mothers. A 2021 study out of Canada analyzed the language in policy documents, guidelines and government reports and found older mothers were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/13698575.2022.2057453?journalCode=chrs20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 represented as}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Crisk-producing subjects, as unnatural mothers, and as irresponsible reproductive citizens\u8221\'20\'1D. If you get pregnant past the age of 35 in the US then you\u8217\'20\'19re basically treated like you\u8217\'20\'19re on death\u8217\'20\'19s door. Phrases like \u8220\'20\'1Cgeriatric pregnancy\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cadvanced maternal age\u8221\'20\'1D are bandied around and your pregnancy is automatically considered high-risk.\par \par \uc2 The same stigma, the same guilt, doesn\u8217\'20\'19t attach to older fathers: most men in their late 30s aren\u8217\'20\'19t fretting about their biological clocks and wondering whether they ought to freeze their sperm. And yet the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7803514/#:~:text=Older%20paternal%20age%20may%20be,methylation%20%5B67%E2%80%9369%5D."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risks associated with declining sperm quality}}}\uc2  are very real: studies show that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rutgers.edu/news/older-fathers-put-health-partners-unborn-children-risk-rutgers-study-finds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 men over 45}}}\uc2  can put their partners at risk for increased pregnancy complications and infants born to older fathers are at greater risk of birth defects.\par \par \uc2 Having said all that, I should point out that news of De Niro\u8217\'20\'19s new baby hasn\u8217\'20\'19t exactly been greeted with unanimous high fives and cheering for his virility. The Daily Mail, for example, published two op-eds essentially calling him a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-12074597/JACI-STEPHEN-Robert-Niro-having-new-baby-79-just-plain-selfish.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 creepy}}}\uc2  old man who wasn\u8217\'20\'19t going to live long enough to see his kid grow up. And the Daily Mail, not exactly a bastion of gender equality, even called out the gendered hypocrisy around when it\u8217\'20\'19s acceptable to have a baby. Sexist double standards when it comes to parental age are very real but it seems that when you start having kids over the age of 75 things start to even out.\par \par \uc2 Linda Yaccarino\uc2  named CEO of \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Yaccarino is the former chairman of global advertising and partnerships of \uc2 NBCUniversal\uc2  and she is very, very good at what she does. If Musk wants to regain trust with marketers and start pulling in ad dollars again, he probably couldn\u8217\'20\'19t have picked a better person. However, this does look suspiciously like a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2019/may/25/women-theresa-may-set-up-to-fail"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 glass cliff}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D scenario. Women \u8211\'20\'13 and ethnic minorities \u8211\'20\'13 are often given leadership positions or promotions when the odds of success are very low and the organisation is facing a crisis. Musk appointing a fall woman is very on-brand.\par \par \uc2 Spain women\u8217\'20\'19s race apologises for food processor gift\par \par \uc2 \u193\'00\'C1ngela Rodr\u237\'00\'EDguez Pam, Spain\u8217\'20\'19s secretary of state for equality, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/madrid-womens-race-food-processor-sexism-811a41b7bdd2cab4b1127f045eaef722"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted in a tweet}}}\uc2  that the winner of the seven-kilometer race had received a food processor and other participants were given 0% fat products: \u8220\'20\'1CIf you win: housewife and if not at least you\u8217\'20\'19ll lose weight.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A year after Shireen Abu Akleh was killed, there has still been no justice\par \par \uc2 Thursday marked one year since the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2022/may/17/shireen-abu-aqleh-was-a-lifeline-for-palestinians-and-her-killing-has-shaken-us-to-the-core"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trailblazing Palestinian-American journalist}}}\uc2  was killed by Israeli forces while reporting on a military invasion of a refugee camp in the occupied West Bank. Since then nobody has been held accountable \u8211\'20\'13 although, after initially saying they had nothing to do with it, the \uc2 Israel Defense Forces\uc2  have finally said \u8220\'20\'1Csorry\u8221\'20\'1D. The apology may have been prompted by a recent report from the \uc2 Committee to Protect Journalists{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2023/05/11/middleeast/idf-apology-shireen-abu-akleh-intl/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 which found no accountability was}}}\uc2  taken by the Israeli military over its killings of at least 20 journalists, 18 of whom were Palestinian, over the past two decades. The Biden administration, meanwhile, has kept shamefully silent about the killing of an American citizen; Biden didn\u8217\'20\'19t even bother mentioning Abu Akleh while talking about the importance of protecting journalists at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thenation.com/article/world/shireen-abu-akleh-death-anniversary/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the recent White House Correspondents Dinner.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics saw significant increase in violence and threats post-Roe\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://rewirenewsgroup.com/2023/05/11/report-details-alarming-rise-in-violence-against-abortion-providers/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A new report}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 National \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Federation\uc2  (NAF) found that arson at \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics was up 100% in 2022 compared to the year prior. The increase in incidents of stalking of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers, patients and staff in the year since Roe v Wade was overturned is up 229%. \u8220\'20\'1CTheir ultimate goal is to eliminate \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  facilities across the country, by any means necessary,\u8221\'20\'1D a NAF executive said.\par \par \uc2 In Philly? Come watch me in conversation with feminist thinker Kristen R Ghodsee\par \par \uc2 Next week I\u8217\'20\'19m going to be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://libwww.freelibrary.org/calendar/event/122207"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 talking to Ghodsee}}}\uc2  about her new book, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bookshop.org/p/books/everyday-utopia-what-2-000-years-of-wild-experiments-can-teach-us-about-the-good-life/18860196"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Everyday Utopia}}}\uc2  : a series of thought experiments on how to create a more just and equitable society. Ghodsee is also the author of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/kristen-r-ghodsee/why-women-have-better-sex-under-socialism/9781568588896/?lens=bold-type-books"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why Women Have Better Sex Under Socialism}}}\uc2 , which examines the myriad ways in which capitalism is bad for women.\par \par \uc2 The week in paw-triarchy\par \par \uc2 Happy birthday to Bobi, a purebred Rafeiro from Portugal, who just {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.abc.net.au/news/2023-05-12/world-s-oldest-dog-bobi-celebrates-his-31st-birthday/102341280"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 celebrated his 31st birthday}}}\uc2  and is officially the oldest dog in the world. No news yet on whether he\u8217\'20\'19s considering fathering any more pups.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Do you have an opinion on the issues raised in this article? If you would like to submit a response of up to 300 words by email to be considered for publication in our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/tone/letters"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  letters}}}\uc2  section, please {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:guardian.letters@theguardian.com?body=Please%20include%20your%20name,%20full%20postal%20address%20and%20phone%20number%20with%20your%20letter%20below.%20Letters%20are%20usually%20published%20with%20the%20author%27s%20name%20and%20city/town/village.%20The%20rest%20of%20the%20information%20is%20for%20verification%20only%20and%20to%20contact%20you%20where%20necessary."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 click here}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230513ej5d001md\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
