\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 US doctors: how are you navigating  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  restrictions?\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian community team \par \uc2 166 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 May 2023\par 09:25 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 We are interested in hearing from doctors and other healthcare workers in the US who have seen the care they can offer affected by laws on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Across the country, a raft of different \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions have left doctors unsure of when and how they can intervene to provide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care. Many of the laws have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/feb/22/diary-doctor-navigating-total-abortion-ban-tennessee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 focused on doctors}}}\uc2 , threatening license suspension and criminal charges for those who defy \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions \u8211\'20\'13 which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/mar/07/texas-abortion-women-lawsuit-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are often poorly defined and hard to decipher}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 We want to hear about how doctors and other healthcare workers are navigating these restrictions. How has the quality and kind of care you can provide changed due to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions? What sorts of situations are you finding patients in since \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws began to change? And what steps have you taken, if any, to work around new restrictions?\par \par \uc2 If we would like to publish your experience, we will contact you first.\par \par \uc2 Callout\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230510ej5a001js\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\pics