\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Republican donor pauses \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  funding over  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  and book banning\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly \par \uc2 415 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 April 2023\par 12:18 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Thomas Peterffy\uc2  says Florida governor \u8216\'20\'18seems to have lost some momentum\u8217\'20\'19 in undeclared bid for 2024 presidential nomination\par \par \uc2 A top Republican {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.opensecrets.org/outside-spending/donor_detail?cycle=2020&id=U0000004660&type=I&super=s&name=Peterffy%2C+Thomas"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 donor}}}\uc2  said he had paused plans to fund \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s expected presidential run because of the Florida governor\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cstance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and book banning\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.opensecrets.org/search?order=desc&q=Peterffy+&sort=A&type=donors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Thomas Peterffy}}}\uc2 , founder of \uc2 Interactive Brokers\uc2 , a digital trading platform, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/9fa26170-5533-4e0b-a852-238b0ef15118"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  the \uc2 Financial Times\uc2 : \u8220\'20\'1CI have put myself on hold. Because of his stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and book banning \u8230\'20\'26 myself, and a bunch of friends, are holding our powder dry.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Peterffy also noted that DeSantis \u8220\'20\'1Cseems to have lost some momentum\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis has not declared a run but is widely expected to do so. He is the closest challenger to \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  in polling of the Republican primary field but despite winning re-election in a landslide and signing into law a succession of hard-right policies, he has not closed on the former president.\par \par \uc2 Last week, DeSantis {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/apr/13/florida-six-week-abortion-ban-republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signed}}}\uc2  a six-week {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/13/florida-democrat-lauren-book-fight-six-week-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban}}}\uc2 . Nationally, Democrats seized on the move, threats to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights having worked to Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 disadvantage in numerous recent elections.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis has also tried to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2023/apr/13/the-guardian-view-on-us-book-bans-time-to-fight-back"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remove books}}}\uc2  dealing with LGBTQ+ issues from Florida public schools, while other laws have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/11/ron-desantis-florida-gun-control-permitless-carry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 loosened gun rights}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/12/ron-desantis-voting-rights-black-voters-florida-gerrymander"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 targeted Black voters}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After Peterffy\u8217\'20\'19s intervention, the \uc2 New York Times\uc2  reporter Maggie Haberman, a leading voice on Trump and Republican electoral politics, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/maggieNYT/status/1647326414293590020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CA major donor finally goes on record with what has been a whisper: donors are getting worried.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But as Haberman also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/maggieNYT/status/1647326414293590020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 , Peterffy still gave himself \u8220\'20\'1Ca lot of wiggle room to resume with DeSantis without fully breaking from him\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Peterffy said he still supported DeSantis in his fight with \uc2 Disney\uc2 , one of the largest employers in Florida, over LGBTQ+ rights.\par \par \uc2 The company has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/04/disney-bob-iger-ron-desantis-florida"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pushed back}}}\uc2  against DeSantis over a \u8220\'20\'1Cdon\u8217\'20\'19t say gay\u8221\'20\'1D law pertaining to the teaching of sexuality and gender in public schools.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis retaliated by attacking \uc2 Disney\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s self-governing powers in the state. The entertainment giant responded, seeking to block the move.\par \par \uc2 Petterfy said: \u8220\'20\'1CI think it\u8217\'20\'19s insane that a company would take a stand on gender issues.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Nor did he say he would not support DeSantis at all.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI am more reluctant to back him,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe are waiting to see who among the primary candidates is most likely to be able to win the general, and then put all of our firepower behind them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230417ej4h0015w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
