\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 Fate of US  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  drug hangs in balance ahead of Friday deadline\b0\par\par\uc2 Mary Tuma \par \uc2 883 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 April 2023\par 17:11 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Mifepristone will lose its \uc2 FDA\uc2  approval this week unless an appeals court intervenes in a case likely to reach the supreme court\par \par \uc2 FDA\uc2  authorization for a key \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  drug could be nullified after Friday, unless an appeals court acts on a Biden administration request to block last week\u8217\'20\'19s ruling suspending approval of the drug.\par \par \uc2 The drug, mifepristone, is used in more than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.guttmacher.org/article/2022/02/medication-abortion-now-accounts-more-half-all-us-abortions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 half of all the abortions}}}\uc2  in the US. The ruling, issued by a federal judge in Texas, applies across the country.\par \par \uc2 Writing that the ruling would \u8220\'20\'1Cinflict grave harm on women, the medical system, and the public\u8221\'20\'1D if it went into effect, the Department of Justice on Monday {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/apr/10/us-appeals-texas-judge-abortion-pill-ruling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 requested the fifth US circuit court of appeals}}}\uc2  temporarily block Judge Matthew Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s ruling while the appeals process plays out.\par \par \uc2 The issue may ultimately fall into the hands of the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  and its conservative supermajority, which eradicated \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights last year by overturning Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 Kacsmaryk stayed his decision for seven days to allow the Biden administration time to appeal. Shortly after the ruling from Texas, an Obama-appointed Washington district judge, Thomas Rice, issued a contradictory ruling that directs the \uc2 FDA\uc2  to keep the drug available in 17 states.\par \par \uc2 The dueling opinions set the stage for the supreme court to possibly intervene.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COn one hand, you have a ruling that says to defer to the expertise of the \uc2 FDA\uc2  and keep the status quo while another says to second-guess the \uc2 FDA\uc2  with junk science,\u8221\'20\'1D says David S Cohen, law professor at \uc2 Drexel University\uc2 , who focuses on reproductive rights.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen you have different rulings from different federal courts it is more likely for the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  to get involved.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The New Orleans-based appellate court is one of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/law/2021/nov/15/fifth-circuit-court-appeals-most-extreme-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 most conservative}}}\uc2  in the US. Republican appointees comprise three-quarters of its bench, with six judges nominated by former president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . The court has routinely ruled against the Biden administration and on behalf of Texas\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws.\par \par \uc2 If the appeals court declines to put a hold on Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s ruling, then the Biden administration would probably appeal to the supreme court.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s possible that the mifepristone issue makes its way to the [supreme] court this week, either because the fifth circuit refuses to even temporarily pause Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s ruling, or because it takes too long to do anything,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stevevladeck.substack.com/p/22-the-mifepristone-mess#footnote-2-113715007"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 writes}}}\uc2  Steve Vladeck, a constitutional law professor at The University of Texas.\par \par \uc2 In his ruling, Kacsmaryk {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/apr/08/texas-judge-kacsmaryk-abortion-pills-ruling-anti-abortion-rhetoric"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 echoed the arguments}}}\uc2  of the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  groups that brought the case, writing that the \uc2 FDA\uc2  disregarded science that the drug causes harm, despite repeated studies finding it extremely safe. Legal experts say that the decision \u8211\'20\'13 the first time the judiciary has intervened to overturn \uc2 FDA\uc2  approval of a drug \u8211\'20\'13 could create a precedent that throws the entire drug approvals system into disarray.\par \par \uc2 More than 250 pharmaceutical and biomedical companies strongly denounced Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s ruling in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://urlisolation.com/browser?clickId=93659538-7134-4635-8523-D106504BFCFD&traceToken=1681163447&pfizer_hosted&https%3A%2Fdocsend.com%2Fview%2F2ahvmwy8&url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocsend.com%2Fview%2F2ahvmwy8djzxax3g"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an open letter}}}\uc2  and warned that it could upend the \uc2 FDA\uc2  approval process as well as the entire US healthcare system.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CJudicial activism will not stop here,\u8221\'20\'1D they cautioned. \u8220\'20\'1CIf courts can overturn drug approvals without regard for science and evidence, or for the complexity required to fully vet the safety and efficacy of new drugs, any medicine is at risk for the same outcome as mifepristone.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Dozens of those companies filed an amicus brief in the case on Tuesday night asking the appeals court to block the ruling. Another brief filed by 240 Democratic members of Congress also asked the court to intervene, while 69 Republican members signed a brief asking the court to uphold the ruling.\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone is used for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , miscarriage management and other medical care. If access to the drug is upended, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers have said they will continue to prescribe the second of the two-drug protocol for abortions. However, that drug, misoprostol, has been found to be somewhat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1363/psrh.12219"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 less effective}}}\uc2  and associated with more painful side-effects than the combination of pills.\par \par \uc2 With the mifepristone in doubt, the Biden administration asked Rice, the district judge in Washington, for clarification on how to proceed if the Texas ruling goes into effect, given that his decision orders the government to take no action that would hinder its availability.\par \par \uc2 Legal experts have argued that the \uc2 FDA\uc2  does not need to enforce Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s ruling, even if it goes into effect.\par \par \uc2 The ruling does not formally compel the \uc2 FDA\uc2  to seize the pills and take them off the market, Cohen says, and leaves the door open for the Biden administration to apply what is called \u8220\'20\'1Cenforcement discretion\u8221\'20\'1D, which would entail issuing guidance protecting the distribution of mifepristone. In the past, the \uc2 FDA\uc2  has granted drug manufacturers this type of safe harbor even in the absence of agency authorization, including for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fda.gov/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/guidance-industry-infant-formula-enforcement-discretion-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 infant formula}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe ruling does not force the \uc2 FDA\uc2  to do anything,\u8221\'20\'1D says Cohen. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s up to the \uc2 FDA\uc2  to determine what to do next. They can use enforcement discretion to protect access to mifepristone. We shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t read into Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s ruling as having more power than it does \u8211\'20\'13 it is limited \u8211\'20\'13 and there\u8217\'20\'19s a huge amount of authority the \uc2 FDA\uc2  can retain.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230412ej4c000p3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
